TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Temizlik de iyi antrenman sayılır
derler, değil mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}
Yer silmek, kuru yaprakları
tırmıklamak{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Belki çevreni
güzelleştirirken güçlenmek de mümkündür!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Cleaning up is usually a pain, but
when you make an event out of it,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I get pretty excited!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Limpiar es una lata, pero si lo
conviertes en una fiesta ya es otra
cosa.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¿A que sí,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Non mi diverto mai quando pulisco,
